    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d464-a11">

                <pb facs="0860" n="750" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg750"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Affidavit of Shalom Kanstoroom.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Jerusalem</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-12-27"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 27,
                        1889.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I, Shalom Kanstoroom, of Jerusalem, United States citizen, in the province of
                    Palestine, Turkishd ominions, do solemnly swear and declare that on the 25th of
                    November, 1889, I was attacked by the Turkish tax collector inside the Jaffa
                    gate, and was forcibly arrested by the collector and his soldiers. When I was as
                    far as nearly half the way, I was met by the American dragoman and cavass; then
                    I was left off. So I demand damage for the unlawful arrest and injustice done to
                    me in the open thoroughfare in Jerusalem to the amount of $5,000.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Shalom
                    Kanstoroom.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
